<title>FRANCE: TENNIS SPOTLIGHT-STATISTICS OF GRAF V SPIRLEA.</title>
<headline>TENNIS SPOTLIGHT-STATISTICS OF GRAF V SPIRLEA.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-06-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Statistics of Sunday's French Open women's singles fourth round match between second seed Steffi Graf of Germany and 13th seed Irina Spirlea of Romania (world ranking in brackets).</p>
<p>Graf won 6-7 (4-7) 6-2 6-2</p>
<p>Time: two hours five minutes</p>
<p>    GRAF (2)   SPIRLEA (13)</p>
<p>Aces 1 5</p>
<p>Double faults 6 10</p>
<p>Percentage first serves 75 70</p>
<p>Forehand winners 20 18</p>
<p>Backhand winners 2 1</p>
<p>Unforced errors 25 47</p>
<p>Break points 14 12</p>
<p>Breaks of serve 6 2</p>
</text>
